  "invariants": [
    "every durable entity has a globally unique ID",
    "every material edge has provenance and temporal validity",
    "no dangling node, edge, hyperedge-member, task-dependency or evidence reference",
    "one canonical authority writer per capability",
    "projections never outrank source events or exact commits",
    "history is superseded, never silently rewritten",
    "verified and qualified statuses require exact-SHA executed evidence",
    "active exclusive claims do not overlap",
    "all P0/P1 gaps have owner, test, evidence requirement, phase and rollback",
    "ContextPacks are stale by default and acceleration only"
